<title>USA: SunGard Data Systems Inc Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>SunGard Data Systems Inc Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				   Year Ended  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				  December 31,	 December 31,</p>
<p>			    1996	  1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenues	    $670,309    $532,628   $193,297   $153,905</p>
<p> Net income	 68,369(A)	52,910  19,696(A)     16,212</p>
<p>Pro forma fully diluted</p>
<p>net income per</p>
<p>  common share	1.59(A)	  1.33    0.46(A)	 0.38</p>
<p>Net income,</p>
<p>  as reported	  34,901	48,672     14,515     13,325</p>
<p>Fully diluted</p>
<p>net income</p>
<p>per common share,</p>
<p>  as reported	    0.81     1.23(B)	 0.34    0.31(B)</p>
<p>Shares used to compute</p>
<p>fully diluted net income</p>
<p>  per common share  43,061   39,668(B)     43,234  42,724 (B)</p>
<p>NOTE - (A) 1996 results exclude full-year and fourth quarter charges of $51,083 and $7,051, respectively ($33,468 and $5,181 after-tax, or $0.78 and $0.12 per share, respectively), for purchased in-process research and development incurred in connection with certain acquisitions and other one-time charges.</p>
<p>1995 results exclude full-year and fourth quarter charges of $4,238 and $2,887 (both before and after-tax, representing $0.10 and $0.07 per share, respectively), for merger costs.</p>
<p>(B) Adjusted to reflect two-for-one stock split which occurred in July 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk, 212 859-1610))</p>
